			  9.2&nbsp;- Fiscaliza&ccedil;&atilde;o Administrativa&nbsp; (as atribui&ccedil;&otilde;es da fiscaliza&ccedil;&atilde;o administrativa est&atilde;o descritas nos arts. 25, 28, II e 29 da IN TSE n&ordm; 11/2021). 

